      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Lagartixa da Floresta. Pequenos ganchos nas solas dos pés de Treecko se prendem a paredes e tetos, impedindo que ele caia mesmo quando fica pendurado de cabeça para baixo. Ele escala rapidamente até superfícies verticais e usa a cauda para sentir a umidade e prever o clima do dia seguinte.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/2 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Dragão, Monstro &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 88% M / 12% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/3</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Treecko pode evoluir para Grovyle no nível 6 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Leafage, Leer, Pound</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Absorb</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Quick Attack</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Mega Drain</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Assurance, Pursuit</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Giga Drain</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Agility, Double Team</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Slam</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Detect</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Energy Ball, Leaf Storm</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Quick Guard</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Endeavor, Screech</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Acrobatics, Aerial Ace, Agility, Assurance, Attract, Breaking Swipe, Brick Break, Bullet Seed, Confide, Crunch, Dig, Double Team, Dragon Tail, Drain Punch, Endeavor, Endure, Energy Ball, Facade, Fling, Focus Punch, Frustration, Giga Drain, Grass Knot, Grass Pledge, Grassy Glide, Grassy Terrain, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Iron Tail, Leaf Storm, Low Kick, Magical Leaf, Mega Kick, Mega Punch, Nature Power, Protect, Rest, Return, Rock Slide, Rock Tomb, Round, Safeguard, Screech, Seed Bomb, Sleep Talk, Snore, Solar Beam, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Swift, Swords Dance, Synthesis, Take Down, Tera Blast, Thief, Thunder Punch, Toxic, Trailblaze, Upper Hand, Work Up, Worry Seed</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Absorb, Bullet Seed, Crunch, Crush Claw, Double Kick, Dragon Breath, Endeavor, Grass Whistle, Grassy Terrain, Leaf Storm, Leech Seed, Magical Leaf, Mud Sport, Natural Gift, Night Slash, Razor Wind, Slash, Synthesis, Worry Seed</p>",
